{"id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-language-decision.md","title":"Decidable Language","display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","aliases":["73-df-dtm-language-decision","73-df-decidable-language"],"display":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-language-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-language-decision</span><span>73-df-decidable-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-language — Decidable Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (deterministic Turing-machine class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> (machine semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选对象、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为候选集合；接受与拒绝只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 中的机器实例调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\bigl(M=S\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\bigl(M=S\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both membership and nonmembership force a halting outcome, so a decider halts on every input.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M$ and $L(M)$ (machine semantics, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M,\\operatorname{Reject}_M","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\land\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n\\bigl(M=S\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n((w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w))\n\\land(w\\notin L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Decides}(M,L)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1359,"backlinks":[{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]；$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。它们均不依赖程序编码；下述接口不存在以待定义编码解释“可计算”的循环。"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}$、$\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}$ 与 $\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 分别见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。最后的表示对应式中的 $f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为任意部分函数，不预先假设可计算性；$\\beta$ 固定为本文件的同一双射。"},{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (decidable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]])"},{"id":"1d543e6e6f293638","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"749da0bcf0da6c50","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e3aa745a4d7cc44","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (decidable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]])"},{"id":"fd777d11b311e27a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["888d8ab66ec7efca","8630ed136c8dde2d"]}